==English==

===Pronunciation===
*{{IPA|[ˈtʃɪlbleɪnz]}}

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun}}

# {{pathology}} An itchy purple red inflammation of the skin, especially of the hands, feet and ears. It occurs when [[capillary|capillaries]] below the skin are damaged by exposure to cold weather.

====Synonyms====
* [[erythema pernio]]
* [[pernio]]

